      "body": "Fixes the 11 mypy errors in `tests/models/deepseek_v41`. Adds it to `SILENT_GROUPS` along with `flint`, `hy_v4` and `qwen3_5 `which were already clean. No changes under `vllm/`.\r\n\r\nThese four directories were still checked with `follow_imports=skip` which meant mypy couldn't see real types from `vllm` and missed errors in them. `deepseek_v41` already had 11 errors hidden that way and with several DSv4.1 PRs touching those tests, the count would keep growing. Moving them to `SILENT_GROUPS` means CI catches new errors as they land. It also leaves only the loose `tests/models/*.py` files for PR 9 and the PR can therefore stick to the parent rollups.\r\n\r\n\r\nPart of #49569.\r\n",
